  <heading level="2">
    <text>HTML Blocks ✅</text>
  </heading>
  <paragraph>
    <text>Raw HTML blocks are supported. A block starts when a line begins with </text>
    <code>&lt;</code>
    <text> followed by a letter, </text>
    <code>&lt;/</code>
    <text>+letter, </text>
    <code>&lt;!--</code>
    <text>, </text>
    <code>&lt;?</code>
    <text>, or </text>
    <code>&lt;!</code>
    <text>, and continues until a blank line.</text>
  </paragraph>
  <html_block>&lt;div&gt;
This is an HTML block.
&lt;/div&gt;

  </html_block>
  <html_block>&lt;p&gt;This is a paragraph HTML block.&lt;/p&gt;

  </html_block>
